      "evidence": [
        "Native CFG1 full-base trial229504bd produced a valid41-frame480x832/25fps H264/AAC1.64s video, but the full-body fixture showed weak mouth movement. A closer portrait and speech-only window with the official Apache-2.0 Lightx2v I2V adapter are being qualified. CFG1 matches the installed template and avoids doubled audio conditioning. Negative prompt is not exposed because CFG1 skips the unconditional branch.",
        "Native prompt4faec568-7764-46e4-9c70-980c87b41b0f succeeded with a close portrait and a voiced window using the official Apache-2.0 I2V adapter:480x832,49frames,25fps,H264+AACAUDIO1.96s,SHA91d6021852410427663461995edca3902e337e9c79e74b3eac97ca8160b49d04. Filmstrip shows mouth opening during speech and closed at the quiet end. No quantitative phoneme alignment or broad identity/quality guarantee is claimed."
      ]
